          "uuid": "7c63d2cb-444c-556-aa1-475d24aadf62b0",
          "description": "Acidithiobacillus ferrooxidans is a chemolithoautotrophic (uses inorganic chemicals for energy and makes its own organic molecules from carbon dioxide), non-spore forming, Gram-negative organism that resides in extremely acidic environments.",
